WEBVTT

00:05:29.704 --> 00:05:33.121
where all of my close friends dropped me
because I wasn't cool enough for them.

00:05:34.163 --> 00:05:38.329
And I never really realized until until
you started talking about performance

00:05:38.371 --> 00:05:43.954
armor that my way of coping with with
that experience was to try to be

00:05:44.163 --> 00:05:45.829
exceptionally good at whatever I did,

00:05:46.038 --> 00:05:49.329
because then people would respect me
or look up to me here like me.

00:05:49.704 --> 00:05:53.246
And so first it was in sports saying, OK,
if I can excel in diving, you know,

00:05:53.246 --> 00:05:55.538
then I'll have I'll have earned, you know,

00:05:55.538 --> 00:05:59.913
a badge or some admiration and and maybe
I'll be accepted as opposed to rejected.